window.products.push({"id":714089,"name":"2022 Upgraded LED Lighted Halloween Tree Decoration Purple with 20 Bat Light Beads String Light, 22 inch USB/Battery Operated Tabletop Halloween Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613aa-fx3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🦇【2022 LATEST & UPGRADED HALLOWEEN BAT TREE LIGHT】- This 2022 version Halloween LED tree branch light with 3D bat shape string light is a perfect combination to add to your Halloween home decor. You can use the tree light and the bat light string desperately in various occasions and places. The 3D bat shape string light provides two lighting modes: flashing & stay-on, which provide different Halloween vibes. 🦇 【MULTIPLE-USE DECORATION】- The black tree light and the bat string light are two separate pieces. The black tree light has 24 LED beads scattered on each of its branches and the 9.84 FT string light has 20 3D bat shape light beads. You can dress up the tree with the bat string light or put any other ornaments on it. You can even use the tree light for other festivals such as Christmas, New Year or Easter. The bat string light can be hanged on door, wall, window, fence and many more places. 🦇【ADJUSTABLE BRANCHES】- This spooky yet exquisite bonsai shape tree light is thoughtfully designed. Twisting or bending the branches will not affect the lighting. You can adjust the angle and direction of the branches which allow you to easily hang the string light or other ornaments on the tree. This feature is also perfect for kids to assemble the tree light themselves and provides incredible DIY experiences. 🦇【 PERFECT GIFT CHOICE】 - This Halloween tree decorative light can fit into any places. You can put it in living room, dinning room, bedroom, kitchen, office, classroom, restaurant, bar, etc. The black tree light is sophisticated and the 3D bat string light gives a fun touch to it. For more, it is also a Halloween decoration that suitable for any occasion and appropriate for any group of people. You can gift this to friends, family, classmates, co-workers and they will absolutely adore it. 🦇 【BATTERY & USB OPERATED】 - The tree light is powered with the USB cable. Considering you may want to leave the tree lights on for a few days during Halloween, you no longer have to worry about power strain. On the other hand, in consideration of the possibility you may want to put the bat string light in other places, it is powered by 3 AA batteries. Please note that the package will come with a USB cable but does not include an adapter and the 3 AA batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613aa-fx3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIERIZSHI","source_asin":"B0B4V7K3W9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4V7K3W9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4V7K3W9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
