window.products.push({"id":714154,"name":"2 PCS High Borosilicate Glass Tea Infuser the Clear Glass Tea Filter is the Best Tea Strainers and Tea Interval Diffuser for Loose Leaf Tea and Scente","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ln9sT4CzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍵【High borosilicate glass lead-free material】High borosilicate glass is a special glass material, with low expansion rate, resistance to cold and heat shock, and will not break under sudden temperature changes of -20℃-200℃ . High light transmittance and high chemical stability make it safe and durable, environmentally friendly, non-toxic. It is an environmentally friendly alternative to traditional tea sets. 🍵【GOOD FILTERABILITY】Each tea strainer has 8 evenly carved leaks in the bottom . The fine filter opening can help you filter all types of tea leaves and prevent tea residues , particles or debris from leaking . 🍵【PERFECT DESIGN】: The cork is used to seal the tea inside the tea infuser, which can fully infuse the tea leaves, retain the tea aroma to the greatest extent, and make the tea soup taste better. 🍵【EASY TO CLEAN】: The tea strainer is easy to clean, and the leaves will not escape or get stuck in the holes. You just need to fill the base with water, then turn it upside down to pour out the leaves, and then continue to rinse. 🍵【WIDE RANGE OF USES】: Suitable for steeping loose leaf tea, chamomile tea, ceylon tea, raspberry leaf tea and other medium and large teas in most cups and teapots. Very suitable for home or office use, allowing you to enjoy the fun of tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ln9sT4CzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SZLJDKG","source_asin":"B08SQTRLN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SQTRLN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SQTRLN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714155,"name":"joyliveCY 32 pack Hat Racks for Baseball Caps, No Drilling Hat Holder Organizer, Self-Adhesive Hat Hooks for Boys Room Decor, Fashion Hat Hangers for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g9+VohcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Refined & Unique Design】After thousands of practical tests, our professional designers finally confirmed this hat hook with a hollow design. It continues the minimalist design of other styles because our hat holder is designed to showcase your hats, not the hook. But on this basis, we specially added a unique hollow design, so that your hat racks can stand out from the others at once. 【Perfect fit for hat shape】Different from other traditional hooks for hooks or nails, whose weight on a single point is easy to warp the hats and leave a trace of the hook, our new design of hat racks has an elegant radian which can perfect fit for hat shape to avoid deformation. 【Multifunctional Storage & Great decor】These hat holders are excellent storage solutions for many types of hats like baseball caps, snapbacks, flat caps, fitted hats, visors, berets, cowboy hats, sunhat, and flat-brim hats... It can also be used as a hanger for headphones, scarfs, headbands, and other household items that weigh under 500G 【Self-Adhesive & Durable】There is strong adhesive on our hat racks' back, which can ensure the hooks stay mounted over time, able to safely and firmly hang your hat, without any worries about falling off. It is suitable for most flat and clean surfaces, such as wood, tile, plastic, metal, glass, and marble...Do not use it on wallpaper and rough surfaces, and please use it carefully on drywall and painted walls 【No Drill, No Damage】3 steps, you will get strong wall hooks for hanging: 1. PEEL OFF the film of the adhesive pad; 2. STICK it on a clean and smooth surface (Tile, Glass, Plastic, or Various metal surfaces). 3. WAIT for 12 - 24 hours. And when you need to remove them, use a hairdryer to heat the melted glue, they can be easily removed. No need to drill, no residue, no damage to the wall, your best choice for storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g9+VohcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"joyliveCY","source_asin":"B0BG1KCBVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG1KCBVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG1KCBVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
