window.products.push({"id":714253,"name":"Rosy Rings Botanical Reed Diffuser Roman Lavender 13oz - Lasts 6-12 Months, Aromatherapy Diffuser, Reed Diffuser Sticks, Diffuser with Botanicals Perf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61knxtht-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As we welcome spring, fill your home with the beautiful scent of lavender. A blend of true lavender, crisp bergamot, and warm vanilla combine with fragrant eucalyptus leaves to create a blend that will soothe any room. Roman Lavender is a romantic combination of luscious lavender, vanilla and musk with a touch of eucalyptus, adding to the lush depth. It's soothing and calming, elegant and illustrious. This 13oz diffuser lasts 6-12 months! Let the timeless fragrance of lavender bring your favorite room to life. Our premium diffuser is specially formulated to release fragrance gradually, adding a relaxing and inviting ambiance to any space. The bottle is simple and elegant, dispersing authentic aromas of dried flowers and pure essential oil blends. Your home can be your favorite place to retreat, relax and unwind. This decorative fragrance diffuser gently yet completely fills your room with the delicate aroma of fresh-cut lavender. A timeless favorite, this complex scent features crisp bergamot and eucalyptus, elegant true lavender, and creamy vanilla for a warm floral finish. With essential oils and botanical accents, it’s a fragrant bouquet that’s crafted to transform any bedroom, bathroom, or office into a soothing escape. Fill any space with the calm and relaxing fragrance of this essential oil diffuser. With a crisp blend of true lavender and vanilla, and a touch of eucalyptus and crisp bergamot, this scent is an easy way to freshen up your home. Artfully arranged blooms add sweet sophistication to a space, and you get to enjoy for months to come. The aromatic diffuser's striking glass vessel is designed to compliment any décor. Soothing lavender meets with warm vanilla in our Roman Lavender fragrance. With true lavender blended with hints of eucalyptus and bergamot, this scent is the perfect addition to create an inviting atmosphere in any powder room or guest suite. Our diffuser is carefully crafted using traditional methods and all-natural ingredients, leaving you with a pure, clean scent and a beautiful glass bottle that can be reused.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61knxtht-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosy Rings","source_asin":"B09ZGMW13W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZGMW13W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZGMW13W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
