window.products.push({"id":714338,"name":"Paddywax Color Block Artisan Hand Poured Scented Candle, 16-Ounce, Pink/Coral - Sparkling Grapefruit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61stYCft+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Color Block collection adds a playful charm to any minimal room. Carefully hand poured at our Nashville factory, this 16-ounce vessel is filled with our Sparkling Grapefruit scent. Paddywax's soy-blend wax and cotton wick helps your candle burn beautifully. Trim wick before a new burn for a contained flame and even burn. Artfully Crafted - Paddywax is an artisan candle company in Nashville, TN, founded in 1996. Each Paddywax candle features a soy wax blend hand-poured into an easily repurposed vessel with U.S.-sourced cotton wicks. Specializing in candles and diffusers that compliment home decor trends, Paddywax candles are made with quality materials, inspiring color palettes, and intriguing fragrances to set the tone in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61stYCft+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paddywax","source_asin":"B09HXWNYZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HXWNYZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HXWNYZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714339,"name":"DUIERA 51 oz Coffee Carafe Double Walled Thermal Carafe Stainless Steel Thermos Pot, 1.5 L Beverage Dispenser Keeping Hot/Cold - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ST13irkEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP BEVERAGE COLD-The thermal carafe keeps cold over 24 hours or hot for hours. This ensures that your coffee or tea stays hot and fresh, or your iced coffee stays cold and refreshing.The coffee carafe insulated is constructed with BPA free lid and durable 18/8 food grade stainless steel. And the stainless steel carafe double vacuum insulation remaining cool and no sweat on the surface Easy to Add Coffee Mate & Clean-Wanna your drinks more varied?You may need to add some ice, tea bag, juice, coffee, sugar or other things into the stainless steel coffee carafe, fortunately, our wide moth design coffee dispenser will meet you.The coffee carafe wide mouth aslo makes clean it easily Elegant Outlooks & Friendly to Use-The coffee carafe insulated has wonderful size for drink and to handle, which is not too heavy for women and the elderly. And with the stylish outlook , the 51 oz carafe will well highlighting your good taste .The coffee carafe has a large capacity of 51 oz, which makes it perfect for serving beverages to a group of people. This means you don't have to refill the carafe frequently, making it convenient for hosting events or gatherings. Spill-Free Spout-The carafe for hot liquids with leak-proof lid is designed with a new insulated and air-tight structure, the coffee carafe larger size and dual silicon rings and always locks in the correct place. Ultimate comfort in handling through the press of a button, even with a slight tilt, our thermal coffee carafe will not leak one single drip A Thoughtful Gift-The simple and useful coffee carafe is a sweet gift for the one you love, cherish and care, to give him or her a warm company. Especially as Mother's day/ Teacher's day/Wedding/ housewarming/ birthday present","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ST13irkEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUIERA","source_asin":"B09NZYJ2FR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NZYJ2FR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NZYJ2FR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714340,"name":"3 Liter Whiskey Oak Barrel for Aging – Golden Oak Barrel with Polished Steel Hoops – Aging and Recipes Digital Guide included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M9Bfl5rjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our company was founded because we have always loved making our own spirits and liquors. We were never happy though with the quality of barrels available on the market, so we went on a quest to find the very best oak barrels available. After getting sample after sample from nearly every company in North America and rigorously testing them, we found a cooperage (barrel makers) that have standards just as high as ours. We believe in the quality of products and each barrel is backed by a 365 day guarantee against leaks. Our barrels ship with an air tight seal & will still be air and water tight after the initial soaking and curing stages; if not send us a message and we will replace it. Oak is a special wood when it comes to making liquor because it is the only wood that does not rot due to liquid. A quality oak barrel like ours is 100% new oak and is meant to hold your liquor for up to 10 years or longer. Our barrels are a sense of pride for us and they should be for you too. We have barrels in different sizes, 1, 2, 3, 5, 10, 20 liters & can have Black Steel, Polished Steel or Brass for the metal hoops. Each barrel comes Oak spigot with an aluminum valve, cork bung and a premium stand. Each stand has intricate bevels in the wood and is varnished to enhance the appearance along with metal rivets on one side and blank on the other so you can choose what fits you best. We also offer custom laser engraving on each barrel for an additional fee. This can be one of our many popular designs or one of your own. Finally, each order includes a digital copy of our 30 page guide taking you from a novice to an expert so you can make the perfect liquor, spirits, or ale. We’re a small company that is proud of our product. Any questions let us know.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M9Bfl5rjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Golden Oak Barrel","source_asin":"B01HMXDK0Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HMXDK0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HMXDK0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714341,"name":"Milliken Burgundy Signature Dinner Napkins - Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XRr-XJltL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our Milliken Signature Dinner Napkins are proudly handmade in the USA. Made of 100% Milliken spun polyester, these hotel quality napkins will soften after each washing and are treated to fight the toughest stains. Colors will always stay bright and whites will always stay white. Hemmed edges with mitered corners. Sold by the dozen (set of 12). 20\" x 20\" Dinner Size. Available in 36 colors! Care Instructions: Warm water wash with cold rinse. No softeners. No bleach. Tumble dry low. Burgundy is a top-seller for the fall & winter holidays! Milliken signature tablecloths and table runners also available!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31XRr-XJltL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Milliken","source_asin":"B009VJDKI0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009VJDKI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009VJDKI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
