window.products.push({"id":714347,"name":"TimeOffice High Back Mesh Executive Chair with Headrest, Ergonomic Computer Black PU Leather Desk Chair, Comfort Office Task Chair & Best Desk Swivel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oL5WFRucL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCELLENT ERGONOMIC DESIGN TASK CHAIR: A comfortable ergonomic mesh chair has a high back supportive back design & matte white color armrest & backrest. It has a mesh upholstered seat and leather seat. The black leather executive office chair gives you best comfort to make you relax your body. The task chair comes with the executive arms to make your shoulder relax and headrest to give you neck support. TILT CONTROL MECHANISM: Awesome tilt tension control and synchro tilt mechanism with tilt lock allow for movement or stability as needed. You can forward tilt or backward tilt your chair as per your comfort level. The 360-degree swivel allows you to move your chair smoothly with the rolling caster wheels. ERGONOMIC DESK CHAIR FUNCTIONALITY: Gas lift: 3 and Butterfly mechanism. A gas lift chair is a form of an office chair that allows the user to modify their height in relation to the height of a desk, leading to an increase in comfort and ergonomic benefit. In short, this chair is adjustable height chair, which allows to, adjust your mesh task chair's height as per your level. Butterfly mechanism comes with tilt and lock function & widely used to executive chairs and manager chairs. HIGH BACK DESK CHAIR MATERIAL: Office executive swivel chair comes with the upholstered blue mesh material seat & black PU leather material. It also has shining matte white color armrest & a blue mesh material backrest. The headrest material is blue mesh material. TIMEOFFICE CHAIR DIMENSION: Executive office chair product dimensions: 25'' w x 25'' d x 50\" h , Upholstered Seat size : 20'' w x 20.5\" D, Suportive Back size : 20\" w x 30\" h. Shipping weight : 36 lbs. Carton dimensions : 31\" x 11\" x 25\". Item weight: 31 pounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oL5WFRucL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TimeOffice","source_asin":"B01JMD7IUK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JMD7IUK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JMD7IUK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
