window.products.push({"id":714358,"name":"Secopad Non Slip Bathtub Stickers, 20 Large Sea Adhesive Kids Anti Slip Decal Threads for Shower and Bath Tub with Premium Scraper, Each Design About ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QTxWXcPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Your bathtub should be a haven of security and fun for child, not a slippery accident waiting to happen. To solve this potential dangerous situation, we supply new products to provide anti-skid surfaces. The nonslip bathtub stickers set works the same way a tub mat does only that it's easier to set up. It's also lighter and easier to maintain. Cartoon ocean fish images can also bring more happiness to children. ★Design Principle. Each sticker can easily stick to the surface of bathtub using special ecological glue. The upper surface comes with anti slip surfaces, which is harmless to children's skin. At the same time, this design is meant to allow water to flow freely further reducing the chances of soapy water accumulating. ★Advantages. These stickers are designed to stick firmly on smooth surfaces offering a strong adhesion and a great grip. This, further, provides you with a long-lasting slip and fall protection. The special glue used for these stickers can easily be removed without leaving any residue behind. Cartoon ocean fish images pattern, cute and attractive, your baby will fall in love this bath decal at first sight. Skin-friendly material, soft and smooth, gives baby more comfort when bathing ★The package comprises 20 pieces (about 4.5”x3.5”) of sea creative stickers alongside 1 high-quality silicone scraper. Ideally, the 20 stickers can occupy most of the surface of bathtub thereby reducing the risk of accidental slips. On top of that, you can even use some from the 20 stickers on the shower wall or refrigerator to make more fun. ★Service. 1 YEAR NO REASON RETURN SERVICE. This ensures that you bath safely, and helps to prevent accidental slips and falls. If you are not 100% satisfied, send us a message and we will make a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QTxWXcPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Secopad","source_asin":"B0859XQX9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859XQX9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859XQX9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714359,"name":"Song of India - India Temple Room Freshener Spray. Two Bottle Set 100ml or 3.38 oz. Each","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jqxKuCmhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Song of India - India Temple Room Spray Two Bottle Set (100ml Each). Long beloved fragrance now in an easy to use room spray. An effective room deodorizer. Prepared with natural perfume oils. The original, light, fresh scent of holy temples in India. Aroma is designed to smell just like a temple in India. Using only the finest herbs, spices, fragrant wood powders, essential perfume oils and resins to create this heavenly fragrance. A very fine fragrance that matches and blends into the human sense of scents. Perfect for Yoga, Mediation, home, office, closet, pleasant atmosphere any where. A portion of the proceeds from the sale of this product go toward the Song of India Association which was established to help needy children in India","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jqxKuCmhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Song of India","source_asin":"B07NCZB4CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NCZB4CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NCZB4CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
