window.products.push({"id":714458,"name":"Melange 8-Piece Ceramic Steak Knife Set with Black Handle and White Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6N0lGzpL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mélange is about the essence of meals. The new Mélange ceramic knives are beautiful, functional and provide great value. Available in multiple sets and handle options, you have choice to pick knives that suit most to your kitchen needs and lifestyle. Ceramic knives are completely food safe. Knives do not rust or leak/transfer metal ions from long-term exposure to moisture, oils and acids in common foods. They are significantly sharper than steel knives - ceramic blade preserves its sharpness 8-10 times longer than traditional steel blades. Mélange ceramic knives are lightweight and comfortable to use as it weighs approx. Half of an equivalent metal knife. Knives can chip or break relatively easily hence it is important to store them in holder or in a sheath. the Knives come in multiple set options with and without ceramic peelers. Choose between 15 handle options that are ergonomically designed. Handles are made of premium abs material, bamboo or ceramic. Avoid using these knives for carving; boning; chopping; smashing; stirring in hot temperatures. Do not cut frozen or extremely hard food. Avoid excessive bending or dropping. Use on recommended surfaces such as wood or polyethylene cutting board. Do not use on glass, marble, and metal surfaces. Hand wash only under running water and dry it in room temperature. The new universal blocks are flexible, easy to use and durable. The inside of the blocks contain plastic sticks that conform to shape of the knife blade without chipping or dulling it. The blocks can fit knives with blades up to 8\". The inside plastic sticks are removable and can be cleaned in a dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6N0lGzpL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B00RVZ0BD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714458","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RVZ0BD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RVZ0BD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714459,"name":"Libbey Lava Tumbler Glasses, 16-ounce, Set of 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MmJVTesbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add texture and dimension to your glassware collection with Libbey's Lava Tumbler Glasses. The organic design is inspired by the free form shape lava takes as it emerges and then flows through nature. This set of eight tumbler glasses creates a rich tactile experience as each molten glass groove serves as a gripping point. The imperfect and natural shape of the glass also creates a mesmerizing reflection when light passes through to the surface of your table or bar. The organic design is sure to impress guests, while the durability allows for everyday use. This 16-ounce tumbler drinking glass can be used to serve just about anything you might want to sip on! The all-purpose shape makes it perfect for cocktails, soda, ice water and more. Celebrate This! with Glassware from Libbey If you’ve ever sipped from a glass, odds are you’ve already met Libbey. We rank as the top glassware manufacturer in the Americas and one of the largest tableware suppliers in the world. As the runaway leader, we are setting new standards for stability, strength, and growth opportunity. We believe every occasion — big and small — is an opportunity to celebrate life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MmJVTesbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Libbey","source_asin":"B089N2XZQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089N2XZQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089N2XZQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
