window.products.push({"id":714492,"name":"Cast Iron Dutch Oven Pot With Lid, 5-Quart, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IEUsVWXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 QUART CAPACITY: Suitable for 4-6 people, Size 12.2\"(L) x 9.45\"(W) x 6.7\"(H). Includes a cotton potholder to lift the lid. Perfect vessel to cook foods and desserts. NON-STICK & EASY TO CLEAN: Premium enamel coating makes the ceramic dutch oven strong adhesion and longer life. The integral molding is solid and durable. Sturdy smooth inner wall is easy to clean with soft sponge or cloth. HEAT RETENTION & LOCKING IN MOISTURE: Unparalleled heat retention and distribution evenly will improve the taste of food. Dome-shaped lid with distributed condensation bumps on the inside and a tight seal can lock in flavor by promoting continuous circulation of heat and moisture. VERSATILE USAGE: Safe up to 500°F. It is usable on gas, ceramic, electric and induction stovetops, in an oven, or even on a grill. Ideal for stewing, cooking, roasting, frying, baking your favorite dishes. QUALITY DESIGN: Made of thick sturdy cast iron with a glossy enamel, whether it is heated at high temperature or constantly stir-fried, not easy to damage the pot. Two side handles allow for handling easily. It is the perfect gift for cooking lovers - A must for every kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IEUsVWXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yirilan","source_asin":"B09BYP9LP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BYP9LP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BYP9LP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":714493,"name":"A2Z Rug Geometric Style Light Gray Trellis Trendy 5309 Borderless Area Rugs 4'6\"x6'6\" ft Modern Design Perfect for Any Floor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OBQXCz9tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Trendy Trellis Collection The Trendy Trellis rug collection perfectly complements the daily flow of your home and your lifestyle. Its neutral shades will perfectly complement almost any home decor, helping turn your house into a home. Area Rugs Area rugs make your home feel more like home. Our designs are influenced by a range of countries giving them a distinct and unique character. Our range of Modern and Traditional rugs are ideal for brightening up your living room or bedroom with our rugs giving your feet extra insulation from cold floors. But there are actually many reasons why adding a rug to your home may be a good idea, and so it's important to keep all of them in mind to give you ideas as you furnish your place. A beautiful rug can transform a space by adding colour, texture and style. Draughty wooden floors benefit from the beauty of a rug, whether contemporary or traditional in style, not only by creating warmth underfoot but also by enhancing the room with a vibrant colour or a striking pattern. Heat-Set Polypropylene Rugs 100% Heat Set polypropylene rugs, are manufactured with yarn which is processed to produce soft fibres that have increased resistance to wear and tear, making them high quality. They are very durable and repel even more stains making them very easy to clean and a fabulous choice for every room of the home. This type of rug is very resilient to moisture and fading, making it a stunning accessory for your outdoor space, from the patio or the porch to the decking or balcony. Product Care You may vacuum rugs to remove dirt and excess fibre. If loose strands occur, trim with scissors but do not pull.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OBQXCz9tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A2Z Rug","source_asin":"B07QL32W7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QL32W7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QL32W7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
