window.products.push({"id":714517,"name":"Verfanny Soil pH Meter, 3-in-1 Soil Tester Kits with Moisture,Light and PH Test for Garden, Farm, Lawn, Indoor & Outdoor (No Battery Needed) (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z2VnLHznL._AC_SL1382_.jpg","description":"Were you always wondering if you were keeping your garden the proper wetness? “It looks OK, but maybe it is a little dry???” Now get a Soil Test Kit and stop such guessing. With a quick check you can tell if it is indeed dry or wet enough. It tests soil pH & light as well and gives the value directly. You will enjoy this product for its simplicity (plug and read) and the fact that you never have to replace the batteries. How To Use Step 1: Switch moisture/pH/light position Step 2: Stick the probe into the soil about 4 inches or deeper (2/3 of the probes) Step 3: Adjust the position of the probe until the pointer on the dial swing slightly Step 4: After 10 minutes, Note moisture/pH/light level in the dial Step 5: Remove probe from soil and wipe clean after each use Tips 1. Don't insert the probe agaist stone or very hard soil in case to damage the probe 2. Please wipe and clean the probe after each time using. 3. Don't leave the meter in the soil for a long time 4. Designed for testing soil, don't use it to test pure water or other liquids. 5.The indicator will not move If the soil is too dry, please water the plant first and test again later.6.Don't leave it in the soil for more than an hour for use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z2VnLHznL._AC_SL1382_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Verfanny","source_asin":"B07XQ8L792","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XQ8L792","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XQ8L792","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
