window.products.push({"id":714579,"name":"Rose Gold Confetti Balloons 12 Inches(20-Pack), Shiny Party Balloons with Metallic Rose Gold Confetti Pre-filled, Kids' Birthday Balloon, Party Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E4sjWOdkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE: You'll get 20 Pcs 12\" clear balloons with rose gold confetti inside. Inflatable diameter is approx. 12 inch. (Not includes sticks, arch kit or balloon column stand) The rubber band at the uninflated balloon mouth is only used to prevent sequins leakage. Please do not use it to tighten the inflated balloon. SUITABLE FOR ANY OCCASION: Decorate your party with our rose gold balloons is a fashion way to make the moved & surprised atmosphere following your party theme. These rose gold birthday decorations will undoubtedly live up a booth or any room, and they are also the luxurious decor for outdoor activities. They can use as the baby shower balloons or a wedding balloons column or the table balloons bouquet for a birthday party. And it's also a romantic setting for a bridal shower, proposal HIGH-QUALITY & CONFETTI FILLED: These confetti balloons use premium thick and durable latex material, 100% natural material, non-toxic. The uninflated clear balloon is yellowish but the bigger you blow it up, the more transparent it will be. Each iridescent balloon is pre-filled with 0.6-inch diameter rose gold confetti. We use foil confetti rather than the paper confetti to make it sticks to the balloon much more easily and more bright. HOW TO USE: HELIUM OR AIR SUITABLE. Make static electricity by rub the inflated against hair, clothing, or carpet while turning the balloon around evenly. The static helps the confetti stick to the balloon. High-quality helium and inflating the balloons to the full size will make it float for 8 hours(though not beyond, because they will pop!). Don’t forget to fasten the balloon tightly! Warrant: If these party balloons are not in good condition, or they do not meet your need, please feel free to contact us and we'll immediately send you a replacement or refund your purchase price.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E4sjWOdkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aplusplanet","source_asin":"B07YWHRG7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YWHRG7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YWHRG7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
