window.products.push({"id":714607,"name":"Lefoyer 4 Piece Bamboo Sheets, Sheet Set- 1 Flat, 1 Fitted & 2 Standard Pillow Cases, Deep Pockets, Eco Friendly, Wrinkle Free Sheets, Machine Washabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814SsNZQozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRING HOME LUXURY: Le Foyer Bamboo sheet set is lightweight, airy, and breathable, keeping you cool in the summer and warm when it's cold outdoors. This temperature regulating bedsheet set whisks away moisture, sweating, and any discomfort in exchange for pure relaxation. This sheet is naturally wrinkle resistant, cooling, and very soft, making it great for year-round usage, but especially in the summer. Our sheet set is luxurious, stylish, and the softest sheets you'll ever own. A FLAWLESS FIT: Le Foyer Bamboo bedsheet comes with a wide and strong elastic all around the corners of the sheet with 17 inches deep pockets that prevent the sheets from shifting and losing corners. The sheet comes with top and bottom labels for hassle-free installation. Furthermore, the envelope closure on the pillowcases, ensures that your pillows are always kept within. The sheet set can be washed in a Washing Machine. USE ALL YEAR AROUND: These are the ideal cool sheets for hot sleepers - They're thermoregulated to keep you cool in the summer and warm in the winter. They are also moisture wicking, which helps to keep you dry. PACKAGE INCLUDES: This Queen size Bamboo bedsheet sheet set includes, 1 flat sheet (90\" X 102\"), 1 fitted bedsheet (60\" X 80\"+ 15\") with 17-inch pocket with 360° elastic, 1 Standard pillowcovers set (20\" X 32\") MADE IN GREEN: We put the same effort into the manufacturing process of our bedsheet set as we did for its quality. Our bedsheet sets are made utilizing 100% Green renewable power. We are a women-positive workforce, with about 75% of our workforce being women. Our bedsheet sets are manufactured in a sustainable and eco-friendly environment, and all our sheets are OEKO- TEX (R) certified for chemical safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814SsNZQozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LE FOYER LUXURY IN EVERY INCH","source_asin":"B0BN6WTH7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN6WTH7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN6WTH7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
