window.products.push({"id":714660,"name":"Masticating Juicer Machines, Hethtec Cold Press Juice Extractor with Large Double-Chute and Clean Brush for Fruits and Vegetables, High Yield, BPA-Fre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfO8wgpbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The HETHTEC Masticating Juicer is an upgraded version of the vertical slow juicer. 3\" wide enough can fit in whole uncut fruits and vegs like apple, save up on preparation time. This juicer includes almost all the functions that a juicer should have, It is your preferred for life. Product Feature: ● 3 Inch Wide Mouth Feed Chute ● 60RPM Low-Speed Masticating Technology ● 30% More Juice than Centrifugal Juicers ● Dual safety lock design, safety locking arm makes sure the cover is on tight while operating ● Automatically Separates Juice from Pulp ● Easy to Clean and Disassemble ● 304 Stainless Steel Main Body Specification: ● Speed: 60 RPM ● Voltage: 110~120 V ● Power: 150 W ● Package Size: 16.3 x 13.2 x 7.7 inch ● Sound: <60 db ● Weight: 8.16 lb Tips: 1. Please read the instructions carefully before using this cold press juicer. 2. The slow juicer can only be started if it is properly installed. 3. It can be used for frozen fruits and vegetables but not directly for crushing ice, which can damage the machine. 4. When making almond milk or soy milk, you should soften the beans by water in advance. 5. Coconut, cane sugar is inapplicable to this appliance. 6.This juicer only applies to home using rather than commercial using. 7. It is recommended not to use the juicer for more than 10 minutes, which will affect the motor use next time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nfO8wgpbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hethtec","source_asin":"B07Y18BX5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y18BX5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y18BX5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
