window.products.push({"id":714870,"name":"Homykic Bamboo Ladder Shelf, 4-Tier Bathroom Shelves Bookshelf Bookcase Book Storage Plant Stand Rack Freestanding Floor for Home Bathroom, Living Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yq77ZUU3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ATTRACTIVE ACCENT LADDER SHELF- Features 4 fixed open ladder shelves perfect for storing and displaying. The steps get wider from top to bottom, offering plenty of space for creativity. Line the shelves with flowers, plants, books, decorations, or photo frames for a unique storage shelf. You can also revamp that cluttered corner with this contemporary ladder bookshelf. 4-TIER MULTIDUTY STORAGE SHELF - The ladder rack can be used as a plant stand, bookcase, bathroom storage, room organizer in your bathroom, living room, bedroom, kitchen, balcony, office, corridor or any other space. Potted plants will get plenty of sunlight within the shelves thanks to the open sides and slatted shelf. STURDY CONSTRUCTION - Trapezoidal structure ensures overall stability. 90° Right-angle design on the rear makes the bookcase stands freely or sits flush against the wall perfectly. Will not waggle or topple even without using the anti-falling parts. LIGHTWEIGHT BUT STURDY - Overall dimensions 18.9”L X 12.6”D X 43.3”H with net weight 8.38 LBS. This ladder shelf boasts a great bearing capacity of 33 lb per level and expertly maximizes space for all your storage essentials. KEEP IT CLEAN AND TIDY AT ALL TIMES - The surface of solid wood bamboo is coated with waterproof varnish to makes it delicate and smooth. So the bookshelf is moist-resistant and won't get dirty easily, it is very easy for you to maintain it. In order to prolong the service life, please avoid prolonged use in a high humidity environment. DECORATE YOUR HOME - The natural look of the bamboo makes it the perfect match for any neutral color palette. You can add this decorative storage shelf to any room in your home to instantly create a stylish and rustic farmhouse feel that will last for years to come. ASSEMBLY TAKES ONLY 10 MINUTES OR LESS - Comes with detailed and illustrated instructions and required tools for a worry-free assembly. 4 protective caps on the bottom to ensure ladder shelf stands stably while protecting your floor from scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yq77ZUU3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homykic","source_asin":"B0987KLP3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0987KLP3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0987KLP3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
