window.products.push({"id":714905,"name":"seliger Ultrasonic Fogger/Mister/Humidifier with Controller- Multi Color LED Lights, Transformer and 12.75 Foot Cord - Great for Parties, Halloween","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eIaKC0w0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Introducing the Seliger German Engineered Mist Maker: a perfect fusion of stunning design and cutting-edge technology. This high-performance fogger features a nickel-plated brass body, combining unparalleled aesthetics with exceptional durability.  At the heart of this mist maker lies a ceramic disc membrane, pulsating at ultrasonic frequencies to produce a thick, mesmerizing fog without the need for dry ice or chemicals. Powered by a 24V, 30-watt ultrasonic oscillator, this compact yet powerful device operates efficiently, ensuring minimal impact on your energy consumption even during extended use.  One of the key highlights of this fogger is its advanced smart sensor technology, which automatically detects water levels and safely shuts off the device when the water level drops too low, giving you peace of mind during extended use.  What truly distinguishes the Seliger Mist Maker is its unparalleled versatility and control. Create a tranquil atmosphere with a gentle, color-changing sequence of reds, blues, and greens, or energize your party with a fast-paced strobe effect. Alternatively, set the mood with a static color of your choice. This fogger also allows you to independently control the mist and lighting functions, offering endless customization possibilities.  This all-inclusive kit provides everything you need for an extraordinary sensory experience, right out of the box. It includes the fogger, transformer, controller, and a replacement ceramic disc kit with an installation tool.  This item is backed by a 2-year warranty.  Specifications:  Ceramic Disc Diameter: 16mm. Power Cord Length: 12.5 ft. Operating Water Temperature: 41° - 144°F. Minimum Water Depth: 1¾\". Upgrade your ambiance with the Seliger German Engineered Mist Maker, and transform any space into an enchanting haven. Click \"Add to Cart\" Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eIaKC0w0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"seliger","source_asin":"B00Q74VVZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q74VVZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Q74VVZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
