window.products.push({"id":714926,"name":"Gifts for Dad from Daughter to My Dad Blanket Best Gift for Fathers Day Birthday Christmas Valentines Day Bday Present Idea for Father Husband Men Him","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tKNyFjpyL._AC_.jpg","description":"💝LETTER:to my dad，if I could give you one thing in life，I would give you the ability to see yourself，through my eyes only then would you realize how special you are to me，thank you for believing in me more than I believe in myself，thank you for your constant support，endless love & for being my everlasting friend，I will always be your little girl and you will always be my greatest hero，love, the one who needs you till the end，your daughter. 💝GREAT FOR FATHER'S DAY GIFTS:birthday gifts for dad, dad gifts, dad Valentine's day gifts, thanksgiving day gifts for dad, dad stocking stuffers gifts, Christmas gifts for dad. Unique dad gifts for the new dad, dad to be, dad friends, father in law, stepdad, foster dad, wife father in your life. 💝PERSONALIZED CUSTOM BLANKET:The pattern of this blanket is a letter, a gift from daughter to dad way for the giver to express love，make him feel warm and loving. When he watching TV, reading books, on the couch, on a bed, on chilly nights ,it's a perfect companion for your dad. 💝SOFT THOUGHTFUL GIFT: This super-soft flannel blanket is designed for a thoughtful caring personal gift for a dad from a daughter. The intent of this blanket is not only to bring warmth but also to bring a smile, courage, and a feeling of love. Give dad something that shows you love and care about your dad, don't settle for a boring or generic gift. 💝GIFT IDEAS FOR DAD:Are you still worried about finding a meaningful gift for dad? This dad blanket is a meaningful and practical birthday gift for dad. Thanks and love to Dad, all in this blanket. This blanket can accompany Dad for a long time, and Dad can also feel his daughter's love and admiration for him. This will be his most precious gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tKNyFjpyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lpmisake","source_asin":"B09XK3GLXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XK3GLXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XK3GLXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
