window.products.push({"id":714972,"name":"YEMYHOM 100% Non-Slip Loveseat Slipcovers Anti-Leakage Sofa Loveseat Covers 2-Cushion Couch Protectors Dog Furniture Covers (Loveseat, Light Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h5wHcL-DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANTI-LEAKAGE: YEMYHOM Sofa Covers are compunded by 3-layers fabrics. The Water-resistant layer in middle prevent water from flowing through the dog covers onto the couch, so as to protect sofas from cat or dog pee, wine or coffee spills! Attention, The top layer fabric is NOT Waterproof, it'll catch the liquids and prevent it from rolling onto the floor to cause extra messes! Just dry the top fabric with a dryer when it gets wet STAY IN PLACE: Firmly covered on your sofa, YEMYHOM pet dog couch covers don't slide off when you install it according to our instruction. It will have a great Anti-slip performance! The furniture protectors with side pockets are specially designed for American and European sofas, suitable for most styles of sofas. (ATTENTION: Be sure to refer to our “Installation Guide” in photos before purchasing and installing!!!) SIZE: Please measure your sofa seat width(not including arms) before purchasing!! YEMYHOM sofa slipcovers for living room are best suitable for sofas with SEAT WIDTH (Sofa XL) up to 88\", (Sofa) up to 70\", (Love-seat) up to 52\", (Chair) up to 23\". See \"MEASURING GUIDE\" of this slip covers in our Photos!! The pet covers are great for extra large recliner sofas, Loveseat, Armchair, T sofa, sleeper sofa, oversized leather couch COMFORT: Modern designed with Jacquard polyester Fabric, which is stylish and cozy. EASY CLEAN: This is a Removable pet furniture cover, taken off easily for washing when getting dirty. Hand washing and machine washing are both fine, and hang dry. The elastic straps on the sofa protector should be taken off before washing BRAND GUARANTEED: 24-hours professional online customer service, to answer all kinds of questions from customers. If our couch slipcovers are not 100% satisfied, you can refund, return or exchange at any time. If have any problems of this couch protector during usage, just send a message to us on Amazon, we will solve it for you immediately","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h5wHcL-DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEMYHOM","source_asin":"B078HMF6P9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-714972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078HMF6P9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078HMF6P9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
